  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multinational - Shelter-Afrique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the proposed TA is to strengthen SHAF&apos;s capacity to promote the provision of sustainable housing on the continent.  A strengthened SHAF will be better positioned to support increased participation of the private sector in the housing sector, a necessary condition if the housing problem on the continent is to be addressed. The Company will also me able to engage in increased policy dialogue with member states in a bid to eliminate bottlenecks in housing development.</narrative>
  </description>
